# Internal Linking Placement

Internal links must appear in TWO specific places only.

1) Inside the "Next steps" section
2) Inside a "Related fixes" section near the bottom

Rules:

- Maximum 3–4 related links
- Use descriptive anchor text
- Never output long link paragraphs
- Never repeat the same link multiple times

Every error page must include:

• link back to its protocol hub
• 2–3 related fixes from the same protocol cluster